# Build output. Committed: the circuit json, the .srs (2^20 since CA 1 is
# pinned: 67,109,076 bytes, under GitHub's 100 MiB file limit, so the app
# downloads it from the release tag like every other circuit's), the
# .srs.toolchain marker, the vk, the SHA256SUMS digests, and the Solidity
# verifier (forge compiles every script under ../script, so it must exist in
# a fresh checkout). Witnesses and proofs stay local.
target/*
!target/coinbase_attestation_v2.json
!target/coinbase_attestation_v2.srs
!target/coinbase_attestation_v2.srs.toolchain
!target/SHA256SUMS
!target/CoinbaseAttestationV2.sol
!target/vk/
target/vk/*
!target/vk/vk
!target/vk/vk_hash
!target/vk/SHA256SUMS
